# varbit_io_diff dictionary (PARSER-INVENTORY lane). Tokens for the
# bit_in/varbit_in text language: the B/X prefix set + binary/hex digit runs +
# the odd-nibble / bad-digit / prefix-only adversarial shapes. Input layout is
# [selector][atttypmod:4 LE][text]; these tokens seed the text tail. CmpLog +
# dictionary is day-one for parser-shaped targets (fuzzuproof-crate skill).
# prefixes
"b"
"B"
"x"
"X"
# binary digit runs
"0"
"1"
"1010"
"b1010"
"B0011"
# hex form + odd-nibble edges
"x1f"
"Xabcdef"
"x0"
"x123"
# bad-digit / adversarial
"b2"
"xg"
"z1010"
